01:15:08.890 --> 01:15:22.520
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder Mr. Torey Malatia, who was horrified to learn that the New Yorker is coming out with a thousand-page holiday edition of the magazine. Imagine, imagine the collective weight on the front stoop.
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生，他得知《纽约客》要出一本一千页的假日版杂志时感到非常震惊。想象一下，想象一下放在前廊上的总重量。

01:15:22.520 --> 01:15:26.890
<v Adams>This issue will destroy New York City.
<v Adams>这个问题将会摧毁纽约市。

01:15:26.890 --> 01:15:31.650
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of this American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周同一时间，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

01:15:31.650 --> 01:15:31.860
<v Ira Glass>["NEW YORK, NEW YORK"]
<v Ira Glass>["纽约，纽约"]

01:15:31.860 --> 01:15:36.860
<v Ira Glass>(SINGING) If I can make it there, I'll make it anywhere. New York. It's up to you, New York.
<v Ira Glass>（歌唱）如果我能在那里成功，我就能在任何地方成功。纽约。纽约，一切取决于你。
